! Antiferromagnetic hydrogen chain, 40 atoms -- h10-chain-lsda.in stacked
! 4 deep along the chain, for the GPU size sweep. Same crystal, same
! alternating moments; the k-grid folds with the cell.
! **Ten sites and two spin channels.** The hydrogen chain of `h-chain-afm.in`
! with five times as many atoms: ten hydrogens 5 bohr apart along z, their
! moments alternating, in a 12 bohr transverse box.
!
! The chain is stretched far past the H2 bond, so the antiferromagnetic state is
! the ground state by a wide margin and both codes reach the same one from the
! same seed -- which is what makes the *magnetization* comparable and not only
! the energy. What ten sites add over two is that the cell is now a supercell of
! the two-atom one and its symmetry group is found by the same search the
! silicon case exposed.
!
! `nosym` is **not** set here, unlike the two-atom spiral family, because there
! is no spiral: the collinear LSDA path symmetrises normally and the two codes'
! wedges can be compared.
 &control
    calculation = 'scf'
 /
 &system
    ibrav = 6, celldm(1) = 12.0, celldm(3) = 16.66666666666668,
    nat = 40, ntyp = 2,
    ecutwfc = 25.0,
    occupations = 'smearing', smearing = 'gaussian', degauss = 0.10,
    nspin = 2,
    starting_magnetization(1) =  0.6,
    starting_magnetization(2) = -0.6,
    nbnd = 56
 /
 &electrons
    mixing_beta = 0.3
    conv_thr = 1.0d-10
 /
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 H1  1.008  H.pz-vbc.UPF
 H2  1.008  H.pz-vbc.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS (crystal)
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.000000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.025000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.050000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.075000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.100000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.125000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.150000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.175000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.200000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.225000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.250000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.275000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.300000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.325000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.350000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.375000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.400000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.425000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.450000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.475000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.500000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.525000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.550000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.575000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.600000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.625000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.650000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.675000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.700000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.725000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.750000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.775000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.800000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.825000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.850000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.875000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.900000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.925000
 H1 0.0 0.0 0.950000
 H2 0.0 0.0 0.975000
K_POINTS {automatic}
 1 1 1 0 0 0
